`getAllMessages` returns an array of message documents. This React 18 component is mounted under `ConvexProvider` with a new Convex 1.44.0 client and no cached query result.

```ts
import { useQuery } from "convex/react";
import { api } from "../convex/_generated/api";
export function Messages() {
  const messages = useQuery(api.messages.getAllMessages);
  return <pre>{JSON.stringify(messages)}</pre>;
}
```
